  /// of the Vault API response. When using e.g. /auth/token/create the "data" section is empty but the
  /// "auth" section contains the generated token. Please refer to the vault docs regarding the result
  /// data structure. Additionally, accessing the raw response is possibly by using "Raw" result type.
